WEBVTT

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:09.926
A NETFLIX SERIES

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:12.470
SHOGAKUSHA

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:13.388
Huh?

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:15.348
A short-term series?

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:18.184
You know the standalone
printed in the last issue?

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:20.562
It seems that one had good reviews.

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:21.730
Seriously?

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.773
Unexpectedly. Haha.

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.568
So if you could
flesh out the story a little more,

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:30.655
it could be a three part series, or even
a long-term series if it goes well.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:32.240
Wow.

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:34.701
This is a crucial moment.

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:35.910
Right.

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:38.788
Oh, sorry. I have to get going.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:43.001
Oh, I do try to avoid meeting you
during this time on weekdays.

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:44.335
Sorry.

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:46.629
It's okay. I'll make it on time.

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:50.467
Your schedule will become
even busier from now on.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.595
Will you be okay with
dropping off and picking up Kotaro?

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:55.472
Yes. I'm not worried.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:58.058
I'll balance both him and work.

00:00:59.017 --> 00:00:59.976
Understood.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.690
Kotaro! Let's go home.

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:07.567
I came to pick you up.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.863
Pardon me, but who are you?

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:14.199
Ah, please don't worry.

00:01:14.282 --> 00:01:17.827
I'm an acquaintance of Shin Karino,
and he asked me to pick Kotaro up.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:21.164
I have ID, and I'm not a sketchy person.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.750
So Kotaro, let's go home.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:27.170
Just in case, to prove that
you know Sir Karino,

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:29.005
name one of his characteristics.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:30.840
Yeah, he's cheeky.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:33.593
He's unreliable, as you can tell
from his looks.

00:01:33.676 --> 00:01:35.011
Yes. Alright.

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.471
What? That's alright?

00:01:37.055 --> 00:01:39.641
It seems that Shin is busy today too, so…

00:01:39.724 --> 00:01:41.017
Is that so?

00:01:41.643 --> 00:01:44.604
Well, I will get my hat and shoes.

00:01:45.688 --> 00:01:48.274
Then please give this to Mr. Karino.

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:50.860
I've told him before,

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.445
but this is a reminder.

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:54.781
The entertainment show.

00:01:54.864 --> 00:01:56.616
Isn't this the day…

00:02:02.872 --> 00:02:06.042
Are you Sir Karino's ex-girlfriend?

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:10.004
Yes. I've had stuff happen, so I've been
living with Shin for the last three days.

00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:12.632
I see.
Well, let me introduce myself again.

00:02:12.715 --> 00:02:14.592
I am Kotaro Sato.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:17.804
Oh, yes. I'm Akane Nitta.

00:02:17.887 --> 00:02:21.808
Huh? Akane, didn't you say
you were going out to go shopping?

00:02:21.891 --> 00:02:25.520
That was a lie. I went to pick up Kotaro.

00:02:25.603 --> 00:02:26.521
You're busy, Shin--

00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:29.732
More importantly,
why are you letting a stranger pick you up

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:31.818
and coming home with them?

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:34.070
She said she knew you.

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:36.197
But that's not foolproof, is it?

00:02:36.781 --> 00:02:37.907
Also, Akane.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.326
Were there any notes from the teacher?

00:02:40.952 --> 00:02:42.328
No, there was nothing.

00:02:43.872 --> 00:02:46.749
THREE DAYS EARLIER

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:47.917
Long time no see.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:50.086
Akane? What made you show up out of the--

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:53.298
I'm fighting with my boyfriend
and left the house for a bit.

00:02:53.381 --> 00:02:54.674
You live nearby.

00:02:54.757 --> 00:02:57.010
It's perfect.
Can I crash here for a while?

00:02:57.093 --> 00:02:59.470
Huh? What do you mean "perfect"?

00:02:59.554 --> 00:03:01.973
Oh! Manga! You're working on one again?

00:03:02.056 --> 00:03:03.600
It makes me kinda happy.

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:06.436
You had stopped making them,
saying you were done.

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:10.273
At one point, yes. I wasn't producing
results and went off the rails.

00:03:11.649 --> 00:03:13.067
You're busy?

00:03:13.568 --> 00:03:15.361
Especially right now.

00:03:15.445 --> 00:03:18.406
This might turn into a long term series.

00:03:18.489 --> 00:03:21.159
Wow, what a great opportunity!
That's amazing!

00:03:21.242 --> 00:03:22.076
Right?

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:27.332
I'm going out for a bit,
so make yourself at home.

00:03:27.415 --> 00:03:30.210
Shopping? If so, I'll go for you.

00:03:30.293 --> 00:03:32.754
You're crunched for time right now.

00:03:32.837 --> 00:03:34.547
No. I gotta pick him up.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:37.884
Who?

00:03:46.476 --> 00:03:48.353
I'm not convinced…

00:03:51.189 --> 00:03:52.190
Therefore,

00:03:52.774 --> 00:03:55.735
for the time being,
I'll drop you off and pick you up.

00:03:55.818 --> 00:03:56.653
Hmm?

00:03:56.736 --> 00:04:01.074
Actually, Shin is busy
and is working really hard.

00:04:01.157 --> 00:04:02.492
His deadline is close,

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:05.620
and he hasn't slept properly in days,
so he's tired.

00:04:05.703 --> 00:04:09.666
So if he has to pick you up, drop you off,
go shopping and go to the bathhouse,

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:11.626
he'll be even busier.

00:04:12.168 --> 00:04:14.796
So this is happening. Thanks.

00:04:20.051 --> 00:04:21.219
I'm home.

00:04:21.928 --> 00:04:23.471
Where did you go?

00:04:23.554 --> 00:04:26.516
I am a burden for Sir Karino.

00:04:28.559 --> 00:04:30.228
Let's get stronger together!

00:04:32.355 --> 00:04:33.564
Yes!

00:04:34.148 --> 00:04:36.484
He said we would get stronger together,

00:04:37.151 --> 00:04:40.530
but am I a burden to Sir Karino?

00:04:44.867 --> 00:04:47.287
I will not go with you anymore.

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.746
Huh? What do you mean?

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:52.500
The bathhouse, shopping,
picking me up or dropping me off…

00:04:52.583 --> 00:04:54.711
I no longer want to go with you.

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:56.379
What the heck?

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:58.172
- Kotaro, let's go.
- Huh?

00:04:58.756 --> 00:05:02.677
You should get a certain amount of work
done before taking a break.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.387
Leave Kotaro to me.

00:05:06.431 --> 00:05:08.641
Why are you coming with us?

00:05:08.725 --> 00:05:10.893
You don't have time for this, right?

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:11.811
For this?

00:05:11.894 --> 00:05:13.521
You've been pulling all-nighters

00:05:13.604 --> 00:05:16.441
for this deadline that has
your manga career on the line,

00:05:16.524 --> 00:05:19.068
Maybe Kotaro is just looking out for you.

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:20.194
Akane,

00:05:20.945 --> 00:05:22.530
did you say something to him?

00:05:22.613 --> 00:05:23.740
Not really.

00:05:25.366 --> 00:05:27.785
I'm not gonna change the way I do things.

00:05:31.789 --> 00:05:32.915
Lady Akane.

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:34.042
Yes?

00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:36.961
Sir Karino is busy as usual, yes?

00:05:37.045 --> 00:05:39.422
He was up all last night too.

00:05:39.505 --> 00:05:42.342
So that is why he is in that zombie state.

00:05:42.425 --> 00:05:43.384
Shin?

00:05:44.052 --> 00:05:45.636
Seriously, why did you come?

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:48.056
Because that's what I decided.

00:05:48.139 --> 00:05:51.768
Isn't the deadline tonight?
Are you stupid?

00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:53.019
Say what you will.

00:05:53.603 --> 00:05:56.481
Don't tell me he plans to come
to the Entertainment Show today?

00:05:56.564 --> 00:05:59.233
Shin, do you remember what day today is?

00:05:59.317 --> 00:06:02.445
You mean
the deadline for my manuscript, right?

00:06:02.528 --> 00:06:03.696
Anything else?

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:04.781
There's nothing else.

00:06:06.115 --> 00:06:06.991
Hey!

00:06:12.497 --> 00:06:14.665
It's almost time
for the Entertainment Show.

00:06:16.751 --> 00:06:19.045
I'll go to the convenience store
for a bit.

00:06:19.128 --> 00:06:20.171
Have fun.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.803
Okay, the first part
of our Entertainment Show

00:06:26.886 --> 00:06:29.764
let's have the audience listen to the song
we practiced so much.

00:06:29.847 --> 00:06:31.015
Okay!

00:06:36.604 --> 00:06:41.692
Papa, mama, friends, teachers.

00:06:43.319 --> 00:06:45.988
Kotaro seems a little down.

00:06:47.532 --> 00:06:48.783
Shin?!

00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:51.869
Always

00:06:53.704 --> 00:06:55.331
Together

00:06:55.915 --> 00:06:56.999
Okay.

00:06:58.042 --> 00:07:00.336
Why? I thought you'd forgotten.

00:07:01.003 --> 00:07:03.005
I wouldn't forget something like this.

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:04.549
You lied.

00:07:04.632 --> 00:07:05.800
Pot, meet kettle.

00:07:05.883 --> 00:07:08.803
Ms. Bird, Mr. Wind

00:07:10.888 --> 00:07:14.684
Thank you, thank you

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:17.228
Kotaro is losing spirit again.

00:07:17.311 --> 00:07:19.355
What about the manuscript?

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:21.941
Once this ends,
I'll go home and finish it.

00:07:22.024 --> 00:07:24.569
I've stayed up all night for a few days
and am on track.

00:07:25.736 --> 00:07:27.363
You're just a neighbor.

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:30.741
You're not obligated to look after Kotaro.

00:07:30.825 --> 00:07:32.493
No, I'm not obligated.

00:07:32.577 --> 00:07:36.247
In that case, I think it's better
not to involve yourself with that kid.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.916
Since you definitely
can't take that responsibility.

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:43.171
At the very least,
I wanted to remember this for him.

00:07:44.172 --> 00:07:49.218
Normally, parents watch over and remember
the development of their kids, right?

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:50.136
Yeah.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.555
I think those memories

00:07:52.638 --> 00:07:54.474
are proof of living.

00:07:55.433 --> 00:07:58.561
As you say, I might not be able to take
responsibility for him.

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:02.857
There's a chance he might be separated
from me tomorrow.

00:08:03.941 --> 00:08:06.235
Mr. Flower, Ms. Bird

00:08:06.319 --> 00:08:08.154
So I decided, even if it's just now,

00:08:08.237 --> 00:08:12.033
that I would keep track of
his day-to-day life.

00:08:12.116 --> 00:08:14.160
But to sacrifice yourself for that--

00:08:14.243 --> 00:08:15.745
For that reason,

00:08:16.746 --> 00:08:19.790
I want my manga to succeed
no matter what.

00:08:20.541 --> 00:08:23.503
If I fail, he'll think
it's because I was looking after him,

00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:26.464
and he'll definitely feel down.

00:08:27.673 --> 00:08:30.510
Oh, okay. It's the opposite.

00:08:36.432 --> 00:08:39.352
Sorry, Kotaro. I had the wrong impression.

00:08:39.936 --> 00:08:43.564
Kotaro, you were the one
supporting the unreliable Shin.

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:47.527
Shin said he's motivated
to make manga because of you.

00:08:50.738 --> 00:08:53.407
It seems that Shin needs you, Kotaro.

00:08:54.075 --> 00:08:55.785
So, you guys should make up.

00:08:55.868 --> 00:08:56.911
Make up.

00:08:56.994 --> 00:08:59.539
You were the cause to begin with.

00:08:59.622 --> 00:09:01.582
SHIMIZU APARTMENTS

00:09:05.461 --> 00:09:07.797
Huh? What is that, Michael Jackson?

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:11.717
It cannot be helped.
I need to lift him up.

00:09:12.343 --> 00:09:15.846
He's really unreliable,
but please take care of Shin.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.098
Yes!

00:09:17.181 --> 00:09:19.141
What's up with you guys?

00:09:22.478 --> 00:09:24.772
This is wonderful, Tamamori!

00:09:24.855 --> 00:09:27.525
Please allow us to sell this shirt
at our company.

00:09:27.608 --> 00:09:31.028
No, actually, I have already been asked
by another brand.

00:09:31.112 --> 00:09:33.030
Haha!

00:09:35.032 --> 00:09:37.159
Yes, who is it?

00:09:37.952 --> 00:09:38.911
Huh?

00:09:44.292 --> 00:09:45.918
Do you need something?

00:09:46.919 --> 00:09:49.255
That is a lot of stars.

00:09:49.839 --> 00:09:52.425
Oh, this shirt? Fly, right?

00:09:52.508 --> 00:09:55.970
Well, the clothes I've designed
are much better.

00:09:56.053 --> 00:09:59.849
Hey. Wear your clothes with care.

00:10:00.349 --> 00:10:02.184
Go home and have your mom wash them,

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:03.936
or take them to the dry cleaners.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:07.189
I can't stop myself!

00:10:07.273 --> 00:10:10.776
I can't take it! It bothers me too much.
Okay, arms up.

00:10:11.944 --> 00:10:15.531
As a special service,
I'll get the dirt off this shirt.

00:10:16.949 --> 00:10:19.160
Poor Mr. Shirt…

00:10:19.744 --> 00:10:21.621
Thank you.

00:10:22.622 --> 00:10:24.582
But what's with this situation?

00:10:24.665 --> 00:10:27.627
And why did this kid come here?

00:10:30.796 --> 00:10:33.883
It's a T-shirt I designed. Isn't it cool?

00:10:34.425 --> 00:10:36.677
What is written on it?

00:10:36.761 --> 00:10:39.221
God. It's God. Do you get it?

00:10:39.305 --> 00:10:40.681
It means Kami.

00:10:40.765 --> 00:10:43.726
A genius design, totally godlike.

00:10:45.561 --> 00:10:48.397
- It is lame.
- What? Lame? How?

00:10:49.315 --> 00:10:51.233
It is so lame it is sad.

00:10:51.317 --> 00:10:53.152
What about it is lame?!

00:10:53.235 --> 00:10:56.113
THE NEXT DAY

00:10:58.157 --> 00:11:00.034
You've come again?

00:11:00.117 --> 00:11:03.496
Ah! Your shirt is stained again!

00:11:03.579 --> 00:11:06.457
This type of stain
should be hand-washed with soap,

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.376
then put in the washer.

00:11:08.459 --> 00:11:10.753
Teach your mom this too. Okay?

00:11:12.713 --> 00:11:15.132
Right. Let me show you.

00:11:15.216 --> 00:11:16.050
Huh?

00:11:16.717 --> 00:11:17.802
What do you think?

00:11:17.885 --> 00:11:20.388
The real thing is cool, right?

00:11:20.971 --> 00:11:22.390
I am sorry. It is lame.

00:11:22.473 --> 00:11:25.267
But what's lame about it?!

00:11:27.228 --> 00:11:29.438
A kid comes by himself to your place?

00:11:29.522 --> 00:11:30.356
Yeah.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:34.443
He's been mysteriously visiting
for about half a month.

00:11:34.527 --> 00:11:35.903
You again!

00:11:35.986 --> 00:11:39.031
It's a nuisance for you
to ring the intercom every day.

00:11:41.575 --> 00:11:44.662
Sir Tamamori. Where did you go?

00:11:44.745 --> 00:11:46.747
What? Oh,

00:11:46.831 --> 00:11:50.710
I'll be moving the day after tomorrow,
so I'm getting cardboard boxes.

00:11:52.837 --> 00:11:55.339
You are moving?

00:11:56.006 --> 00:11:57.758
More importantly,

00:11:57.842 --> 00:12:01.178
you were ringing doorbells
other than mine, weren't you?

00:12:01.262 --> 00:12:02.638
That's not good.

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:04.932
You're bothering everyone.

00:12:08.811 --> 00:12:11.897
Oh, right, about the shirt.

00:12:11.981 --> 00:12:14.900
I made the coolest design this time.

00:12:14.984 --> 00:12:17.570
I'll have the sample tomorrow.
Do you want to come see it?

00:12:17.653 --> 00:12:19.196
Either way, it will be lame.

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.448
Hey!

00:12:23.451 --> 00:12:24.702
- Tamamori.
- Huh?

00:12:24.785 --> 00:12:27.538
I don't think that kid
is ringing doorbells as a prank.

00:12:27.621 --> 00:12:28.581
What?

00:12:28.664 --> 00:12:31.584
That kid, maybe because
his parents aren't home,

00:12:31.667 --> 00:12:33.753
wants someone to talk to.

00:12:33.836 --> 00:12:35.379
Huh? What?

00:12:35.963 --> 00:12:38.883
There was a kid like that
when I was in elementary school.

00:12:39.925 --> 00:12:43.387
His parents didn't come home very often,

00:12:44.138 --> 00:12:46.515
so he was often at our place until late.

00:12:47.767 --> 00:12:50.186
In short, he's lonely by himself.

00:12:54.231 --> 00:12:57.610
TYPICAL ACTS OF NEGLECTED CHILDREN
RING STRANGERS' DOORBELLS

00:12:57.693 --> 00:12:59.820
You're bothering everyone.

00:13:03.657 --> 00:13:04.492
THE NEXT DAY

00:13:04.575 --> 00:13:05.534
Rejoice!

00:13:05.618 --> 00:13:08.788
This is my brilliant masterpiece!

00:13:08.871 --> 00:13:10.873
I originally planned on presenting it

00:13:10.956 --> 00:13:13.501
to the world, but it's your special gift.

00:13:16.378 --> 00:13:19.757
I won't be able
to wash your clothes anymore,

00:13:20.508 --> 00:13:22.051
so wear this with care.

00:13:24.637 --> 00:13:26.722
It's the same design as usual.

00:13:27.223 --> 00:13:29.975
Only I would be able to pull this off.

00:13:30.935 --> 00:13:32.353
Thank you.

00:13:33.187 --> 00:13:37.107
I am sorry about
ringing your doorbell so much.

00:13:39.318 --> 00:13:40.152
No,

00:13:40.861 --> 00:13:44.156
keep ringing lots of doorbells,
just as you have been.

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:45.574
Huh?

00:13:45.658 --> 00:13:48.702
There might not be many people
who will respond,

00:13:48.786 --> 00:13:51.288
but don't worry about that,
and keep ringing them.

00:13:52.122 --> 00:13:55.084
It's okay for you
to keep ringing doorbells.

00:13:57.002 --> 00:13:58.128
Take care.

00:14:04.218 --> 00:14:06.387
Hey, I was wondering.

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.722
That T-shirt you wear most days,

00:14:08.806 --> 00:14:10.432
do you like that design?

00:14:10.516 --> 00:14:13.018
This? Yes. It's lame, is it not?

00:14:14.186 --> 00:14:16.188
But I like it.

00:14:16.272 --> 00:14:17.189
Seriously?

00:14:22.111 --> 00:14:23.946
I'm in trouble!

00:14:24.029 --> 00:14:27.491
I didn't think I'd have a bad stomachache
during my first solo delivery!

00:14:27.575 --> 00:14:30.953
Alright, the last delivery
is for Room 203 of this building.

00:14:33.497 --> 00:14:35.541
Good morning!

00:14:35.624 --> 00:14:37.793
You are from Asagao Newspaper, yes?

00:14:37.877 --> 00:14:40.796
Nice to meet you. I am Kotaro Sato.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.549
Hiya! Thanks for your business.

00:14:43.632 --> 00:14:45.342
Since you were later than usual,

00:14:45.426 --> 00:14:48.178
I was about to go ahead
and call your store.

00:14:48.262 --> 00:14:49.972
Oh, sorry about that.

00:14:50.055 --> 00:14:52.933
An issue came up suddenly on the way here.

00:14:53.017 --> 00:14:55.352
That's an impressive number
of morning papers.

00:14:55.436 --> 00:14:57.146
How many do you subscribe to?

00:14:57.229 --> 00:15:00.399
Five. By the way, Sir Delivery Man,

00:15:00.482 --> 00:15:03.777
did that sudden issue turn out okay?

00:15:03.861 --> 00:15:06.030
I'm fine! Thank you!

00:15:07.281 --> 00:15:08.908
What a good kid.

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:12.661
The kid's parents
must be amazing people too.

00:15:18.083 --> 00:15:19.835
I'm on schedule today.

00:15:20.377 --> 00:15:23.756
Haha. Look at all those papers
sticking out.

00:15:23.839 --> 00:15:25.799
He really does get five newspapers.

00:15:25.883 --> 00:15:27.009
Huh?

00:15:27.092 --> 00:15:30.304
Speaking of which,
the name written in my route book

00:15:30.387 --> 00:15:32.181
is "Kotaro Sato."

00:15:32.723 --> 00:15:33.891
Does that mean

00:15:33.974 --> 00:15:36.060
the subscription is under his name?

00:15:39.396 --> 00:15:40.230
ASAGAO NEWSPAPER

00:15:40.314 --> 00:15:42.483
Mr. Yokoi, did you get the subscription

00:15:42.566 --> 00:15:45.110
for Room 203 in the Shimizu Apartments?

00:15:45.945 --> 00:15:48.822
By chance did that kid Kotaro
sign the contract?

00:15:48.906 --> 00:15:50.032
Yes.

00:15:50.115 --> 00:15:53.452
Seems he wasn't living with his parents
for some reason.

00:15:53.535 --> 00:15:54.411
What?

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.625
Kotaro is so nice.

00:16:00.209 --> 00:16:02.378
I wonder if
he was forced into subscribing?

00:16:02.962 --> 00:16:06.256
Seems he wasn't living with his parents
for some reason.

00:16:11.136 --> 00:16:13.639
Sorry for being late.

00:16:13.722 --> 00:16:17.559
I'd overslept because I was thinking
too much and couldn't sleep…

00:16:18.352 --> 00:16:19.603
It is fine if you are safe.

00:16:19.687 --> 00:16:21.271
Man, what a nice kid!

00:16:22.189 --> 00:16:26.110
Kotaro, let's cancel your subscription.

00:16:26.193 --> 00:16:28.237
You were forced into it, right?

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:30.823
It's okay to reject it!

00:16:30.906 --> 00:16:32.992
I don't need to cancel it.

00:16:33.075 --> 00:16:34.118
Huh?

00:16:34.201 --> 00:16:37.496
I want you to continue
delivering the paper to me.

00:16:37.579 --> 00:16:40.249
Then why do you have five newspapers?

00:16:41.083 --> 00:16:43.210
I have a favor I would like to ask.

00:16:44.545 --> 00:16:48.382
If you see more than two days
of newspapers piled up like this,

00:16:48.465 --> 00:16:52.636
could you please be aware
that something may have happened to me?

00:16:53.721 --> 00:16:57.182
My apologies to ask,
but since I live by myself…

00:17:03.647 --> 00:17:06.358
Yes. I've got it.

00:17:12.906 --> 00:17:14.074
Good morning.

00:17:14.158 --> 00:17:15.034
Morning.

00:17:16.618 --> 00:17:18.245
Have you finished reading the paper?

00:17:18.328 --> 00:17:19.705
Yes.

00:17:20.289 --> 00:17:24.168
The names of my mother and father
are not written anywhere.

00:17:24.752 --> 00:17:26.503
I see, that's good.

00:17:26.587 --> 00:17:27.421
Yes.

00:17:27.921 --> 00:17:31.759
Nothing happened according to
yesterday's newspapers as well.

00:17:35.012 --> 00:17:37.765
My mother and father are safe.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:40.726
WHAT I WANT TO TELL YOU

00:17:40.809 --> 00:17:43.729
I've come to visit
a popular shopping arcade!

00:17:43.812 --> 00:17:46.982
Goodness, it's quite calm here.

00:17:54.823 --> 00:17:56.742
The Konomi Shopping arcade

00:17:56.825 --> 00:17:59.119
is a quiet area with kind people.

00:17:59.953 --> 00:18:02.706
Seems there's a flower shop
on the other side of the roof.

00:18:06.043 --> 00:18:07.669
Huh? What happened?

00:18:07.753 --> 00:18:10.756
Sir Karino,
I would like to ask a question.

00:18:10.839 --> 00:18:13.801
Where is Konomi Station?

00:18:13.884 --> 00:18:16.595
Ah, I've heard of it.

00:18:17.346 --> 00:18:19.348
What's up? You have something to do there?

00:18:19.431 --> 00:18:20.766
Yes.

00:18:20.849 --> 00:18:25.145
I have been there once before,
but I don't remember the exact location.

00:18:26.146 --> 00:18:27.940
So I will go myself. Maybe tomorrow--

00:18:28.023 --> 00:18:30.484
I told you,
don't go to places by yourself.

00:18:31.235 --> 00:18:32.903
I'll go with you.

00:18:34.196 --> 00:18:35.364
I understand.

00:18:35.447 --> 00:18:37.825
Then, let's go tomorrow morning.

00:18:37.908 --> 00:18:39.368
Okay, leave it to me.

00:18:47.167 --> 00:18:48.252
You are a liar.

00:18:48.335 --> 00:18:50.170
I didn't lie.

00:18:50.254 --> 00:18:54.258
You said that
you would go with me yesterday.

00:18:54.925 --> 00:18:56.051
You are a liar.

00:18:56.135 --> 00:18:58.137
I said I didn't lie.

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:00.180
That's why I'm rushing now to get dressed.

00:19:00.264 --> 00:19:02.516
It was my bad that I overslept.

00:19:02.599 --> 00:19:06.645
I could have gone by myself
if I wanted to.

00:19:06.728 --> 00:19:08.897
No, I looked up
where you were trying to go,

00:19:08.981 --> 00:19:10.649
and it's pretty far away.

00:19:11.483 --> 00:19:13.819
Besides, you went a while ago, right?

00:19:13.902 --> 00:19:17.030
And, you know, I worry about you.

00:19:17.656 --> 00:19:21.743
But you overslept.
You are a liar after all.

00:19:21.827 --> 00:19:23.787
I said it's not like that!

00:19:25.122 --> 00:19:26.790
Don't doubt me so much.

00:19:26.874 --> 00:19:29.751
I haven't lied to you before, right?

00:19:29.835 --> 00:19:30.878
Besides,

00:19:31.753 --> 00:19:34.381
lying isn't really my thing.

00:19:34.464 --> 00:19:36.800
So I won't start lying to you now.

00:19:37.342 --> 00:19:38.552
You got it?

00:19:40.554 --> 00:19:44.474
Next time, I will send you
a massive amount of alarm clocks.

00:19:44.558 --> 00:19:46.476
Don't! That's terrifying.

00:19:49.646 --> 00:19:51.064
Konomi Station,

00:19:51.148 --> 00:19:54.026
blue roof, lots of trees.

00:19:54.109 --> 00:19:56.486
These notes really are vague.

00:19:57.154 --> 00:19:58.405
Where's your destination?

00:19:58.488 --> 00:19:59.531
The flower shop.

00:20:00.199 --> 00:20:01.408
To buy flowers?

00:20:01.491 --> 00:20:02.993
To buy flowers also.

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:07.789
My real destination should be
close to that flower shop.

00:20:08.582 --> 00:20:10.959
YASURAGI CEMETERY

00:20:11.543 --> 00:20:13.337
A cemetery?

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.254
Yes.

00:20:18.717 --> 00:20:20.219
Do you know the location?

00:20:20.761 --> 00:20:22.095
It should be this way.

00:20:22.804 --> 00:20:26.433
I have been here once before
with my mother.

00:20:29.811 --> 00:20:31.521
WAMIYA FAMILY GRAVE

00:20:32.231 --> 00:20:34.900
I wanted to visit the grave

00:20:34.983 --> 00:20:38.237
of my mother's father and mother.

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:41.657
So this is
this kid's grandpa and grandma's grave.

00:20:42.324 --> 00:20:45.827
Speaking of which, do you remember
your grandpa and grandma?

00:20:45.911 --> 00:20:49.748
As they passed away before I was born,
I did not know them.

00:20:50.624 --> 00:20:53.877
If I see my mother someday,
I would like to ask.

00:20:54.628 --> 00:20:55.504
Sure.

00:20:56.797 --> 00:20:58.465
Someday…

00:20:58.548 --> 00:21:01.218
Well, he should be able to someday.

00:21:02.261 --> 00:21:05.138
Well then, first,
let's clean up the grave.

00:21:05.222 --> 00:21:07.766
Yeah, is it okay if I help?

00:21:07.849 --> 00:21:09.601
Thank you kindly.

00:21:13.605 --> 00:21:16.525
Mr and Mrs. Wamiya, please excuse me.

00:21:16.608 --> 00:21:18.777
I will wipe it from this end.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:23.699
So Wamiya was
your mother's maiden name, yeah?

00:21:23.782 --> 00:21:25.409
Yes. That is right.

00:21:25.492 --> 00:21:28.161
The name of my mother was Sayori Wamiya.

00:21:29.121 --> 00:21:30.664
The characters for her name

00:21:32.916 --> 00:21:34.167
look like this.

00:21:34.251 --> 00:21:35.294
SAYORI

00:21:35.377 --> 00:21:37.754
Ah, I get the general idea.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:39.923
Sayori Wamiya…

00:21:40.674 --> 00:21:43.135
So Sato is your dad's last name?

00:21:43.677 --> 00:21:44.553
Hmm?

00:21:59.526 --> 00:22:03.196
Sir Karino, how long
are you going to stay there?

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:04.114
Huh?

00:22:04.197 --> 00:22:07.826
We finished cleaning,
and offered the incense and flowers.

00:22:07.909 --> 00:22:10.579
It would be good for you
to pay your respects as well.

00:22:11.788 --> 00:22:13.290
It's fine, right?

00:22:14.041 --> 00:22:16.251
I can clearly watch you
paying your respects

00:22:16.793 --> 00:22:18.128
from over here.

00:22:19.296 --> 00:22:20.756
I need to stay still.

00:22:20.839 --> 00:22:21.965
What are you up to?

00:22:22.674 --> 00:22:25.093
You are going to disrupt my concentration.

00:22:25.677 --> 00:22:28.055
I absolutely need to stay still.

00:22:28.638 --> 00:22:31.016
Hey, don't worry about me.

00:22:31.099 --> 00:22:33.518
I cannot help but worry about you.

00:22:33.602 --> 00:22:34.811
Oh well…

00:22:35.812 --> 00:22:38.774
I definitely can't show him this.

00:22:38.857 --> 00:22:40.275
SAYORI WAMIYA
FUMIDA WAMIYA

00:22:40.859 --> 00:22:42.861
I don't know the details…

00:22:43.904 --> 00:22:44.988
but what I do know

00:22:45.739 --> 00:22:48.784
is that he doesn't know that
his mother rests here.

00:22:50.285 --> 00:22:52.204
Sir Grandpa, Lady Grandma,

00:22:52.913 --> 00:22:55.207
I am doing well.

00:22:55.957 --> 00:22:57.918
Please watch over me.

00:22:58.752 --> 00:22:59.795
Also,

00:23:00.962 --> 00:23:03.423
if my mother comes to visit you,

00:23:03.507 --> 00:23:06.718
I would be grateful
if you tell her about me.

00:23:07.427 --> 00:23:10.222
That I have a good, healthy life.

00:23:14.393 --> 00:23:17.270
- Watch your step, okay?
- Okay!

00:23:21.566 --> 00:23:23.026
- Sir Karino.
- Huh?

00:23:24.236 --> 00:23:25.112
Will I

00:23:25.779 --> 00:23:28.198
ever be able to see my mother again?

00:23:29.699 --> 00:23:30.534
I'm sorry.

00:23:31.118 --> 00:23:32.744
I'm going to say this.

00:23:32.828 --> 00:23:35.288
Even if it means you'll hate me for it.

00:23:36.331 --> 00:23:37.374
Sir Karino?

00:23:38.542 --> 00:23:41.503
I'm going to lie to you.

00:23:43.088 --> 00:23:44.047
You'll see her.

00:23:48.677 --> 00:23:49.511
Yes.

00:23:50.679 --> 00:23:53.598
Sir Karino, you are a man of your word!

00:23:54.599 --> 00:23:58.979
If you say so, Sir Karino,
then I believe it!

00:23:59.563 --> 00:24:01.606
You would never lie to me!

00:24:03.859 --> 00:24:05.527
Yeah. You know it.

00:24:10.657 --> 00:24:11.491
Hey,

00:24:12.242 --> 00:24:16.371
the next time you visit the grave,
promise you'll go with me again.

00:24:16.455 --> 00:24:19.166
I understand, but why?

00:24:20.625 --> 00:24:22.210
One reason is to make sure

00:24:22.294 --> 00:24:24.880
he never sees
his mom's name on the grave.

00:24:25.839 --> 00:24:27.174
And the other reason,

00:24:28.133 --> 00:24:30.302
is to pass on to his mom

00:24:31.052 --> 00:24:33.138
all the memories of him as he grows.

00:24:34.848 --> 00:24:38.143
I'm going to have
some business at that grave too.

00:24:39.478 --> 00:24:41.688
I do not really understand,
but that is fine.

00:24:41.771 --> 00:24:44.733
I shall have you accompany me
as my loyal subject!

00:24:44.816 --> 00:24:46.359
Sure, I'm counting on it.

00:24:47.235 --> 00:24:51.531
Oh! Kotaro! Welcome back.

00:24:51.615 --> 00:24:54.117
Welcome back, Sir Tamaru.

00:24:55.202 --> 00:24:56.912
Welcome back to you too, Lady Takei.

00:24:56.995 --> 00:24:58.788
Yeah, good to be home.

00:24:58.872 --> 00:25:01.917
You're in a pretty good mood,
aren't you, Kotaro?

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:05.921
Yes, I have officially made Sir Karino
my loyal subject.

00:25:06.004 --> 00:25:09.799
Huh? So Kotaro is Mr. Karino's boss?

00:25:09.883 --> 00:25:12.511
No, please don't take that too seriously.

00:25:12.594 --> 00:25:14.888
That's about right for Karino.

00:25:14.971 --> 00:25:19.684
You should think of it as an honor,
since you are my first loyal subject.

00:25:21.061 --> 00:25:23.772
Yeah, it seems like you give him
the most trouble.

00:25:23.855 --> 00:25:26.816
That's not true.
If anything, he's the one who--

00:25:26.900 --> 00:25:28.693
What? You slept in.

00:25:28.777 --> 00:25:31.404
Hey! We've moved past that already!

00:25:33.698 --> 00:25:35.825
Kotaro!

00:25:38.495 --> 00:25:42.415
Loyal subjects should not oversleep.
Understood?
